DESCRIPTION:Doors: 6:00PM Show: 7:00PM Lawrence presents Staycation: Coast-
 
to-Coast! A 3-night headline run in Brooklyn at Brooklyn Paramount! Each ni
 
ght will have its own theme and its own surprise special guests\, all of wh
 
ich will be announced soon. Our headline sets each night will feature almos
 
t entirely non-repeating sets\, meaning that over the course of the weekend
 
\, we will play most of the songs from our discography. Buy a single show t
 
icket or save money on a full weekend pass! $1 per ticket is added to suppo
 
rt Save The Music\, helping to provide instruments and music education to p
 
ublic schools. All set times and opening acts are subject to change without
 
 notice. For accessible seating inquiries\, please email us directly at Inf
 
o@BrooklynParamount.com to reserve accommodations. Balcony Includes: Exclus
 
ive Entrance via Dekalb Ave. Balcony Access Private Bar Private Bathrooms P
 
rivate Coat Check Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/lawrence-sta
 
